{"step_index":99,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T02:25:59Z","thinking":"**Considering User Intent**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the core of the user's request. It's about ensuring easy contact – the phrase \"contact 되게 최대한\" implies an emphasis on accessibility for direct communication. I need to figure out what that means in this context, and make sure that this is a key focus of the work.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Contact Details**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the practical requirements. Contactability is absolutely critical for the DB inspection. The user must actively reach out via phone. I need to source active contact details for every company in the 1,000-row dataset where phone numbers are missing or suspect. This requires a comprehensive search across Naver Maps, Kakao Maps, and numerous other web sources. Newly found phone numbers will be highlighted in orange in the updated documents.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Inspect contactability and phone numbers across 1,000 rows\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nfunction parseCSVLine(text) {\\n  const result = [];\\n  let cur = '';\\n  let inQuotes = false;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < text.length; i++) {\\n    const char = text[i];\\n    if (char === '\\\"') {\\n      if (inQuotes && text[i + 1] === '\\\"') {\\n        cur += '\\\"';\\n        i++;\\n      } else {\\n        inQuotes = !inQuotes;\\n      }\\n    } else if (char === ',' && !inQuotes) {\\n      result.push(cur);\\n      cur = '';\\n    } else {\\n      cur += char;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  result.push(cur);\\n  return result;\\n}\\n\\nconst filePath = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.csv';\\nconst content = fs.readFileSync(filePath, 'utf8');\\nconst lines = content.split(/\\\\r?\\\\n/);\\n\\nconst bhmRows = [];\\nfor (let i = 1; i < lines.length; i++) {\\n  if (!lines[i].trim()) continue;\\n  const cols = parseCSVLine(lines[i]);\\n  if (cols[0] === '배현명') {\\n    bhmRows.push({ lineNum: i + 1, cols });\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nconsole.log(`Total 배현명 rows: ${bhmRows.length}`);\\n\\nlet hasPhone = 0;\\nlet hasHp = 0;\\nlet hasEmail = 0;\\nlet hasRespondentPhone = 0;\\nlet noContactAtAll = 0;\\n\\nconst noContactList = [];\\n\\nbhmRows.forEach(r => {\\n  const phone = (r.cols[7] || '').trim();\\n  const hp = (r.cols[9] || '').trim();\\n  const email = (r.cols[10] || '').trim();\\n  const respPhone = (r.cols[55] || '').trim();\\n  const isClosed = r.cols[1] === '폐업';\\n\\n  if (phone) hasPhone++;\\n  if (hp) hasHp++;\\n  if (email) hasEmail++;\\n  if (respPhone) hasRespondentPhone++;\\n\\n  if (!phone && !respPhone && !isClosed) {\\n    noContactAtAll++;\\n    noContactList.push({\\n      line: r.lineNum,\\n      company: r.cols[2],\\n      bizNo: r.cols[3],\\n      rep: r.cols[4],\\n      addr: r.cols[6]\\n    });\\n  }\\n});\\n\\nconsole.log(`\\\\nContact Status Breakdown (Total: ${bhmRows.length}):`);\\nconsole.log(`  - Direct Phone (전화번호): ${hasPhone}건`);\\nconsole.log(`  - Respondent Phone (응답자연락처): ${hasRespondentPhone}건`);\\nconsole.log(`  - Homepage: ${hasHp}건`);\\\n<truncated 356 bytes>","Description":"\"Analyze contact details across 배현명 rows\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\a175f348-8ff3-4533-941e-7ffa2cc72c0b\\\\scratch\\\\contact_audit.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing contact_audit.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Write contact_audit.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
